<title>USA: Thermo Electron to buy its units' securities.</title>
<headline>Thermo Electron to buy its units' securities.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Electron Corp said Tuesday that its board of directors authorized the repurchase of up to $50 million in securities of its publicly held subsidiaries.</p>
</text>
